## ✅ Task 6 — Recommendations

| # | Recommendation | Expected Impact |
|---|---|---|
| 01 | **Cap all discounts at 25%** — require VP approval for exceptions | Recover $76K+ from 51%+ bucket |
| 02 | **Reprice or discontinue Tables** — 15–20% price increase or SKU rationalization | Eliminate $17.7K annual loss |
| 03 | **Shift marketing investment to Technology** — especially Copiers & Accessories | Scale highest-margin category (37%+) |
| 04 | **Introduce regional price floors in TX, OH, PA** — target the $58K loss cluster | Recover losses at state level |
| 05 | **Quarterly discount audits** — flag sub-categories where avg discount >20% and margin <10% | Systematic guardrails |
| 06 | **Review Bookcases & Supplies supplier contracts** — bundling or renegotiation | Convert two loss subs to breakeven |

